---------------------------------------------------------------------------
PARITY MAPPING (web -> native)
---------------------------------------------------------------------------
  props   hourlyData: HourBucket[] + touInsights: TouInsights|null  -> TimeOfUseUpdate{hours:[TimeOfUseHourSample]} pushed by P1/S8 source; insights re-derived in the adapter
  hook    useTranslation                                            -> P1/S10 TimeOfUseStrings facade (NSLocalizedString, table "TimeOfUseAnalysis", web t(key,default) fallback)
  hook    useChartPalette                                           -> TSChartPalette (mid-peak bar/legend fill = palette[0])
  shell   <GlassPanel className="p-4">                              -> TSFadeIn + TSGlassPanel
  title   Clock + t('costAnalysis.tou.title', ...)                 -> header: SF "clock" (statusWarning) + title + freshness chip
  chart   Recharts <BarChart> per-hour <Cell> fill                 -> Swift Charts Chart{ BarMark }.foregroundStyle(band)
          (peak #ef4444 / off #10b981 / mid palette[0])               peak->statusDanger, off-peak->statusSuccess, mid->TSChartPalette[0]
  band    isPeak 14..19 ; isOffPeak >=22||<6 ; else mid            -> TimeOfUseBand.classify(hour:) (pure, unit-tested at every boundary)
  axis    <XAxis interval={2}> (every 3rd label) ; <YAxis>         -> TimeOfUseProjection.axisTickLabels (stride 3) ; integer Y axis
  tooltip <Tooltip content={<ChartTooltip/>}>                      -> .chartXSelection RuleMark -> TimeOfUseSelectionCallout (hour, band, sessions, avg cost)
  legend  Peak / Mid-peak / Off-peak swatches                      -> TimeOfUseLegend (SAME TimeOfUseBandPalette as the bars — can never disagree)
  rail    <h4>Insights</h4> + 4 nested <GlassPanel>                -> TimeOfUseInsightsColumn + 4 TimeOfUseInsightCardView
  cards   Cheapest(green)/Priciest(red)/Busiest(cyan)/OffPeak%(emerald) -> statusSuccess / statusDanger / statusInfo / statusSuccess
  fmt     "$"+fmtNumber(avgCost,3) ; fmtInt(sessions) ; fmtNumber(pct,1)+"%" -> DefaultTimeOfUseFormatting (half-up, grouping, fixed digits)
  copy    "avg ${cost} / session" · "{n} Sessions" · "{pct}%"      -> avgCostCaption / sessionsCaption (web keys avgCost/perSession/sessions)
  empty1  hourlyData.length===0 -> t('costAnalysis.charts.noData') -> .empty phase -> TimeOfUseEmpty ("Not enough data")
  empty2  touInsights===null    -> t('costAnalysis.tou.noInsights') -> TimeOfUseInsightsEmpty ("No insights available")
  layout  grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-3 (chart span-2 + rail span-1)  -> regular width (iPad/macOS): HStack chart+rail ; compact (iPhone): VStack stacked
  i18n    costAnalysis.tou.* + costAnalysis.charts.noData          -> verbatim keys via TimeOfUseStrings (verified against web/src/i18n/en.json)
  telem   (P1/S11)                                                 -> view.opened(surface:"TimeOfUseAnalysis") emitted once on appear

Insight derivation parity note: the web component receives `touInsights` already
computed by `useCostAnalysisData`. Native re-derives cheapest/priciest/busiest +
off-peak share from the SAME hourly buckets — mathematically identical to the hook's
per-session math (the buckets ARE the per-hour session counts + average costs), which
keeps the adapter self-contained and fully unit-testable (cached -> projection).

STATES (every one renders — no hidden surface):
  loading  -> TimeOfUseLoadingView (TSSkeleton bars + insight tiles; reduce-motion safe)
  content  -> TimeOfUseBarChart + legend + 4 insight cards (the web body)
  empty(1) -> TimeOfUseEmpty       (web hourlyData-empty branch — "Not enough data")
  empty(2) -> TimeOfUseInsightsEmpty (web touInsights-null branch — "No insights available")
  error    -> TimeOfUseError (QueryError-equiv, Retry -> model.refresh())
  stale    -> freshness chip (Stale) + connectivity banner + ONE guarded auto-refresh
  offline  -> freshness chip (Offline) + banner; keeps cached numbers, NO refetch
a11y: container summary (state-aware), per-bar VoiceOver label (hour + band) + value
  (sessions), insight-cell combined label, header trait, retry labels, reduce-motion
  animation gate, Dynamic Type via system fonts/tokens.

